2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/d5f2387ff736da20b8520ea1fdffd552.webp?t=1773403951\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on a planet with a shifting day/night cycle and an approaching winter add a layer of strategy. Who knows what threats are lurking in this unfamiliar solar system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/168e31ddb1542531e7eb562e15dc1212.poster.avif?t=1773403951\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/168e31ddb1542531e7eb562e15dc1212.webm?t=1773403951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/168e31ddb1542531e7eb562e15dc1212.mp4?t=1773403951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/6fb5bb0e3fd9b60992f1d1d611917e94.webp?t=1773403951\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your citizens with the means of production and defense, from headgear and to  hammers. A well-equipped citizen is not only more productive but stands a better chance against the elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/52161fd4f3aabb1730d8490f7095a930.poster.avif?t=1773403951\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/52161fd4f3aabb1730d8490f7095a930.webm?t=1773403951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/52161fd4f3aabb1730d8490f7095a930.mp4?t=1773403951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. This is my dream game and I have big plans for continued development, community feedback, and meaningful updates as the game grows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for checking out <i>Hardship</i>.</p>","developers":["Marcus"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/3f1fe1216ecfbfffea0dfbd4e01f16f7d53a40f3/header.jpg?t=1773403951","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1334570/1328898821/d8f2c21287a3fe3513edcde58fcad63270072031/1759129174/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759131243","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1334570/1328898821/d8f2c21287a3fe3513edcde58fcad63270072031/1759129174/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759131243","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1334570/1328898821/d8f2c21287a3fe3513edcde58fcad63270072031/1759129174/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759131243","id":257208343,"name":"HardshipMainMenu","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208343/fc24381f89421fad22be7c773e401acae98f53d9/m